<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I wanted to reach out one last time to see if you are interested in taking advantage of our limited time offer of free Lead Connection Service (LCS) through May 31st. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Agents using LCS see (on average) 20%-30% higher bind rates and significantly increase the amount of leads they can work. Plus we automate your lead returns to save you even more time and money.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<br />
<span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Give me a call at {{{Sender.Phone}}} or book some time with me so you can learn more about how LCS can help you grow your agency: {{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.2"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Cheers,</span></span></span></span></span><br />
